      "source": "Event on the current <a href=\"StartupTimeline.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.metrics.buffering\"><code>StartupTimeline</code></a>. Each event has a start/end time, a\nprecise duration and the complete <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/metrics/StartupStep.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.metrics\"><code>StartupStep</code></a> information associated with\nit.",
      "translation": "当前<a href=\"StartupTimeline.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.metrics.buffering\"><code>StartupTimeline</code></a>上的事件。每个事件都有开始/结束时间、精确的持续时间以及与之关联的完整 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/metrics/StartupStep.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.metrics\"><code>StartupStep</code></a> 信息。",
